MERGE (E17Taxonomy)-[:P2A1_assigned_definition_types]->(E55TerminologyType2)
MERGE (E17Taxonomy)-[:P2A1_assigned_definition_types]->(E55TerminologyType3)
MERGE (E17Taxonomy)-[:P2A1_assigned_definition_types]->(E55TerminologyType4)


